# Allowlist: every rig the app can ASK for has to be named here explicitly.
#
# The trap this rule sets: an ignored .glb still sits on the developer's disk and
# still loads locally, so pointing models.ts at one looks like it works. The
# deployed build has only what git tracks, so the same URL 404s there and the
# avatar never appears — a failure that shows up ONLY in production. male2.glb
# was exactly that, and so had never once been in a deploy.
#
# Keep this list in step with components/avatar/models.ts. Superseded rigs come
# OFF the list and get deleted; they are 30-65MB each, and an unreferenced one is
# dead weight in the build context and in every layer of the image.
!frontend/public/models/girl15.glb
!frontend/public/models/girl15.glb.gz
!frontend/public/models/male_inital08.glb
!frontend/public/models/male_inital08.glb.gz
*.bin
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

